"text-align: center; color: blueviolet\"><b>Average</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\"><img alt=\"Dragon Scale Mail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Scale_Mail_723a12.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Royal Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Royal_Helmet_44a9ae.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer\"><img alt=\"Dragon Slayer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_9866f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Trophy_23028d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Tower Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tower_Shield_ea3208.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.3<br/>August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs/Kha'labal</b> are a common hunting spot. They are very similar to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Dragon%20Lairs%2FTiquanda\">Kha'zeel Dragon Lairs/Tiquanda</a>, but are accessed through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> instead of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>. \n</p><p>For mages level 28 it is advised to summon one or two <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a> to use as blockers since they are immune to fire and attack with <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">exori frigo</a> or other ice attacks. They can be healed with cheap intense healing runes, or massive healing.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-South_Dragon_Lair\">South Dragon Lair</span></h2>\n<p>This is the easiest of the three <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> Dragon Lairs and is situated <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33060,32736,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33060, 32736, 7)</a>.<br/>\n1st floor has 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragon</a> and two <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>.<br/>\n2nd floor has 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>.<br/>\n3rd floor has 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>.<br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in South Dragon Lair</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\"><img alt=\"Scorpion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scorpion_20081f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpion</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">45</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">67</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion%20Tail\">Scorpion Tail</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonbone%20Staff\">Dragonbone Staff</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tip for mages:They can go from lvl 28 using exori frigo and icicle rune .\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Middle_Dragon_lair\">Middle Dragon lair</span></h2>\n<p>This is a harder lair than the south one and situated <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33095,32690,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33095, 32690, 7)</a>.<br/>\nMore Commonly known as the Ank 3x Spawn<br/>\n1st floor has 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>, which can be lured one by one.<br/>\nNorth hole has 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">dragon lord</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>.<br/>\nSouth hole has 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>.<br/>\n2nd floor has 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a> and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">dragon lord</a>.<br/>\n3rd floor has 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">dragon lords</a>.<br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in Middle Dragon Lair</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragonbone%20Staff\">Dragonbone Staff</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">670 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">230 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">440 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-245× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28Gemmed%29\">Book (Gemmed)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Royal Spear (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Mug\">Golden Mug</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Scale\">Red Dragon Scale</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">Red Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\">Dragon Lord Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Slayer\">Dragon Slayer</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-North_Dragon_Lair\">North Dragon Lair</span></h2>\n<p>This is the hardest of the three Ankrahmun Dragon Lairs and situated <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33116,32606,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33116, 32606, 7)</a>.<br/>\nMore Commonly known as the Ank 9 Spawn<br/>\nGround level has 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a> and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> which can be lured one by one<br/>\n1st floor has two respawns. South respawn has 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>, which can be lured one by one. North respawn has 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a>  which can be lured one by one.<br/>\n2nd floor has 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">dragons</a> and 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">dragon lords</a>.<br/>\n3rd floor has 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">dragon lords</a>.<br/>\n4th floor has 8 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>.<br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in North Dragon Lair</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Fire Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Elemental_52695e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">220</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"whi